  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51e85bd63230add3a6940bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋季大型竞赛“日本杯”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5da26d8cd4f25da7d08dc3e5dc4e9129b67df17c68a53ac00778b6edf3d255a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3f1f5b17e086f4bf5d6de6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过磨难之后，\n东海帝王有了脱胎换骨的改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70293507b7f1256e50f4e27f0dc3d6a9a9cdbb2c148a9230da6e07fbc3648cf2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895afbab856e69d7cb4db63d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她斗志高昂地走向赛道，\n准备竭尽全力在这个重要舞台上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "997c4f7acf30c0ddd93c0c71b03814e554c1779d96b67befc7294ab83d321b5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf34b450de7dcadc2ff27b2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "a194ff2b11e4dc29465b7e96ba46fa50af90ca4fdbd5410a9fadda438e8fdd1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c517be185327d2d3fba552eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年底……“有马纪念”。\n东海帝王梦寐以求的\n比赛终于到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f34a44af3a0bb07a0f84f13fe23c985075844b3ff6e11b6b81142843e54f9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cdd317b50ba9bff579b7eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她斗志高昂地发下豪语，\n要在这场比赛赢过鲁道夫象征，\n让粉丝们的评价为之改变──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e52cf86c1252a72c0a1396849f5bf9aec4536565ec8b100911bb4829c14aed09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c1799b2b4635e0b873bd28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王一如既往，\n活力充沛地踏上赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c99bc7ceec22f7de4b5a73137b1d5442e934fb9e6738b0267b2dcb33bf992ca3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf768cac74a0297657aa78f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d46d219bf8338cb3ea32a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过出道战之后，\n东海帝王感受到自己的成长，\n与跻身闪耀系列赛的真实感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a4ff5ac0754f5a0e4fd45243006657f4f04957cbaa0197814cbdc45993359b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6b3a010e9af1d81d0fe07e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……隔天，东海帝王与气槽进行并跑练习，\n虽然被指出经验不足，\n但她无庸置疑的实力也获得了认可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a5ec76cbfe203b2017f510fac9ba67930f952aacc09e9dcf4a4aba682f1582",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca814ecf55b3ae3b1ab948e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她还在进步当中。\n既然要挑战鲁道夫象征，\n就必须展现出相当的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa6738c33c925b2f6a8e5ccfd9d4d33ca765355a234560ef2db12f5ad9f6fec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eb5d76490978d09a3396503",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以鲁道夫象征为目标的\n经典路线……以及“三冠赛马娘”头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7357fb5387da4b34c335f28401f97948d6e5cd06323e3d9c7f9c9317dbac343",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e782ffc57ed0fbc935da8db8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挑战光是赢一场就很不容易的\n经典赛之前……她决定先参加\n“若驹锦标”试试身手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1d0b18c72f53cb3e1969d3e6bf52598dcbb22c75ea12875b15c4674063562a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb5592644bb5365a3466826",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・帝王，出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "712dcfb31bde5507abaa13d7c10c8c3331841418d225469f3ea0e72eec8a9515",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67046d173109e8450e573c1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王在“若驹锦标”\n跑出了漂亮的成绩，\n开心地说“表现还算抢眼”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d95a2cf41862f6819bf8c2459b9d44cd2c3b127d0d53748940bbdedec266c6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43553e357fa1781cb18472a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "热身结束后，她的下一个目标\n是决定世代顶点的\n经典赛第一战──“皋月赏”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f984d96eaef6ebf58a90c4b3c3578cb30d4d1be23df1129f46d73b56205ab957",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ed0c57002582f737ff1d52c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了追平鲁道夫象征创下的\n伟大纪录“称霸三冠”，\n东海帝王的挑战就从这一刻开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94960f915ba7c62fa4951bc87f1e289551bf1d695f0eb5074ddb9fa7448903f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94ceac5a7145616aaa9d994",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若驹锦标结束后・迈向三冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16128f9078042799ac3dc457bc975eb5ea3b557019c0a2aa54a64db48a47172b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50200f9dd687687be8f13558",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“皋月赏”成功赢得胜利，\n东海帝王朝着天空……\n竖起一根指头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e36ad69304837f5467c9701d09768aa756672ff616df8b08bbeb5c948dab3cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8896bd8d1a763c0d93f9a683",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是……鲁道夫象征赢得“皋月赏”时\n曾经做过的动作。\n可以感受到她必定要夺下“三冠”的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67518d88a965a9d9b05bd998ec0ceea23dfc91e93e19178795c5d12a99dbb18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b721d0e3058c42b965ee666f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“日本德比”。\n她将朝着每位赛马娘都想获得的荣耀\n奋力冲刺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cd383504c2b2358cc284455b95c0ff86bbc51435533625e945a091f57582b4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fb10313640f107f51d4a15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・第一冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "277053d52ea9f72b45b27a5319cab25002dfe3599b013be03a2429eceeefa505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc569370cc5c05ef87e4bad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王尽了全力，\n但可惜没有拿到第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf867a094ae94b6e9b0f9bc15c492cb54dddb0f9e3bc128e78509328c2b734d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a55b3098515fd8775dfeab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "注定无法成为与鲁道夫象征\n齐名的“三冠赛马娘”，\n东海帝王感到非常难过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5910c0e56091e309be5a5fa98f8d70fd90a0f9973399e0dde3f058b4fbc8fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d08755967278d09a4ca01d84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员鼓励沮丧的她，\n“尽管无法达到同样的成就，\n但还能超越鲁道夫象征”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49773452a80625bbc943c5bc14f19172fc088bb3a902f3f6171a7bb9b208e511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fcc2fec681e482dea69db84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "重新下定决心的东海帝王\n为了迎接“日本德比”，\n刻不容缓地展开训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc308ead7a04640066d8edd53dca0947831a1011508f9bcf37c588b6af5fe33f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d5da6f1f404506e15a53077",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・挑战还没结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "791e85ba2163a68dc5146641c4e4cdf8e9072a605b9d36818aab662d9c92bdf3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15aa887df8ae92f4fa27148d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "称霸“日本德比”的\n东海帝王朝着天空\n竖起两根指头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86541f92a3ede575a04d506cd1f0c9a425748bfb862ad26cc1bcae0b69030d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
