    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56830e8da516842de637f0aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王形势正旺，\n“三冠赛马娘”的伟大成就\n近在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a733e575bededa260ce3e2d78e3eefecf74c0837155ddc06ce405a1b4ccc22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52eafe63bd9b6ac44236bf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・第二冠！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4843e3a66c4756db2da54934724b0215ed871bcea01e1b44587b0981657fedba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc669eb0414ead82db2d105e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王使“日本德比”的场面\n非常热闹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7dfe9cc28ae52e121572563ebaf05cf03123e74f73e918edafa56a3ecd47407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15dea7b094a1905b1fa83661",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但没能高举象征二冠的胜利手势，\n使她相当不甘心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3424d6e1f6559051af61e9baf170656f9800ba7352a63c3989598a54058c32ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9567d376c4de75f5d427ac9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，东海帝王的挑战\n还没结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6761fc7560be4dfc461b02c5cdbd7b0a64f56a2317270075c5ab1cca20033c25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54baa82c9680191c6fb0493",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了在最后一场\n经典赛“菊花赏”获胜，\n她将继续挑战下去……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc44d538fa84a28c0b8ae797234c4ae5d26b43fdeeb2f1f2b30204cdc5055de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80908147369c5498d28ce3b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・绝不低头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf4d778bc2139afee09b89c1de1bcbe9a7184ca78b96d2aadcfc029f554709a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038070c49233cd79557f265a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王称霸“菊花赏”，\n朝着天空气势十足地竖起三根手指。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb1ffe97e15dd7c0d2945af779c94b6fdfd03ec301fc276c5be50280db6fd0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34b963bd23be63dfb890516d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是她与自己崇拜的鲁道夫象征一样\n成为了“三冠赛马娘”的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3489821c30dd2807a0b85db109fe8c4c518e4c28e05303e40b76b892f38030a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0460a450a3e9e441f2eb66cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，东海帝王的挑战尚未结束。\n接下来她将以“天皇赏（春）”为目标，\n立志超越鲁道夫象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed46d983b1930fbd800bfc4eea4ef408debc21441085807b281100aa0eb28bcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6464fd5074b78f3c693ceb9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・我是三冠赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e41279fe778f7ebf23e30cb3cc290c0e13d628e4d02295d0c365620aa57a7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43f2eb4c680e73c2b96fa63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王快乐地\n跑完“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76fc8e49bba5c1056b482e38a547e89d16998694460ab05263f726d282a42731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85164821c95f9ad079cf0568",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而……没能成为“三冠赛马娘”的现实，\n使她偷偷哭泣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01b5b43e022873547ad9260330fe6587c1de640132058ee9090b9c110e46d88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653780fedc9141443eb8ed67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，挑战经典级也使她成长许多。\n她立刻打起精神，\n订定了下个目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b093aa0cb71f9f3a405df999ff4211b6175080f0c58e54417178b2b71df46c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:275c4fe54508b15d28465ee9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是“天皇赏（春）”。\n接下来……东海帝王的新挑战\n即将拉开序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e92fc90b7f12e67c8721dd7d3b2b1ea01a2c023ec3338ca5784e3413f1675ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a4acea622a49855ef6ba2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・终点还在前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10e5b9893575b15ec721b72defd23430dfa9fb19ab72a7cf4afdc77a5842074",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534a01bf97975a6367c74ec8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王赢过活跃于古马级的目白麦昆，\n展现了自己的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "635d898fe5b3667f44bc58449fbacc179120c847173aeb745cc1beb9ef780f33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61dd85ef9361111882ad47f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员看好这个成绩，\n决定下次让她参加“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f559cedc5075b8ee30bab1b863439deb68862d07041d4f5e20269b0c63d389d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541bcab215cd3b669c82e496",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "数日后，东海帝王看见目白麦昆\n气势汹汹地卖力练跑，\n并赞扬她的努力。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "44db0abd40e8d6be1f0e32707395be28b13dd4746f5d809027e803e994fdff16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4717b4956128ecdf709c5741",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她自信满满地说无论比多少次，自己都会赢。\n没想到鲁道夫象征却给了残酷的评语，\n说“下次未必会是相同的结果”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a81e695442bd50c7ab4457bff0ca70116db04a555b003ddb3df2b6b65d4c4bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257d6381afe90db071dca165",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王准备挑战“日本杯”，\n但她的未来似乎即将遇上波澜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fb13c3f5e311a91582ee0bf8656e8817fb82ef9a9c64a6d1a9a30b9793d7e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b7a07fe24eaf4dd9efd0e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・欠缺的碎片",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f7c84a231851953d438d4287c8a959e607a05467ccb6d786cd83e078392060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a1377aa1cd8872d5371201",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王输给了目白麦昆，\n对方更直接断言“无论比多少次，\n结果都不会改变”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d17b6833e00053428c31d595bf254ae30d1ce22ddff819abce3fe9c3c7048d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b374728866e602c15ede477",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王为了让她能认可自己的实力，\n决定参加“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83bbe8e7e13509f19c2ad85775743de21465d4f42f77f4b6977a2edddbce472f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e744dffda1435b5a56c20eeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "数日后……东海帝王拼命完成训练。\n但是鲁道夫象征却给了残酷的评语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2d7007cde18479519a54b5a87cf6262321e49c3977b42b17380876fae93700",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf3f391b738628c5f8819c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说东海帝王与目白麦昆\n实力相差悬殊，无论比多少次\n都不可能赢过目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f14f3cae61cf96e6ee421360e7fe2187537a786d4b3ec4696bd3f17bb0e21c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d3569362c6524bdafde19de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王准备挑战“日本杯”，\n但她的未来似乎即将遇上波澜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fb13c3f5e311a91582ee0bf8656e8817fb82ef9a9c64a6d1a9a30b9793d7e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
