    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f4bb445a86520a34ce4607",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王在各国好手云集的\n“日本杯”漂亮地赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d90c65ea5c847bbe239b8e062778c9ce4d94d8bd506b216d32277ff3e756e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:911192bb3b7cabb309db7b3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天。\n东海帝王为了见鲁道夫象征，\n前往学生会办公室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fefba067cd5c0f750aa4edf28f8b33f76ff4e328787217ea058227a1fdf0c41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a757971164cc384d54fd4b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对来到学生会办公室的东海帝王，\n鲁道夫象征表示渴望与蜕变为\n“帝王”的她一较高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9df4b0e9feef9312f36adfc025c06873b4c9d7f060b3b03bdf59dda81975f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3fa92d7a43c7c587133afb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决胜的舞台正是年底重大竞赛……\n“有马纪念”！东海帝王渴望已久的\n对决终于要实现了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2be4fd542aaec2fbfc270e865f3ff9c30a6801ca78faa4d9adaf8ca416f9d16f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a6ba564bdd892e1a4697ad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本杯结束后・“皇帝”驾到",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9c25700b93af4d52c4c40793dde7a616dbb5fab47474d57551dbc115b5a86c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72176abd019f7adeeec21f8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在热烈的欢呼声中，称霸有马纪念的\n东海帝王仿佛置身梦中，\n觉得不太真实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e526d688823a06e879489ee261b02f40d1bf25c3493731929aa99af292a3664",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534aaa40b97ed65a1b741eab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征夸赞她的表现，\n宣言一定会拿回被夺走的\n第一名宝座。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96c7ae8943e2a0e79b67ae8325298b0a94a753642f798207bbde5bdc2798e4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a42dd98ad93c26ce77979f0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这番话总算让她感受到\n击败“皇帝”的真实感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a609644ecb14fe997ff7712e6457b67ee67679138b6fab1dbf68a7cde9a2c8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1003/storytimeline_501003429.json",
