      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在鲁道夫象征的催促下，\n她奔向无数观众，\n宣布“帝王”的诞生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67f4f874dd6dba2584feb2f64a53e5a415b0d184f3bfc87150be4a82396008c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
